# CI windows runners check out text files as CRLF (core.autocrlf), but
# golden/template/embed comparisons expect LF. Force LF for the exact
# patterns that tests compare byte-for-byte. Deliberately no *.ps1 rule:
# its CRLF blob must stay verbatim (no renormalization).
*.go text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.tmpl text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
